of the impact of nitrogen addition on methane uptake in alpine grassland. Sci. Rep. 6:32064. doi: 10.1038/srep32064, PMID:</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/srep32064</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC5004186</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">27571892</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhang P. L., Fang H. J., Cheng S. L., Xu M. J., Li L. S., Dang X. S. (2013). The early effects of nitrogen addition on CH<sub>4</sub> uptake in an alpine meadow soil on the Eastern Qinghai-Tibetan Plateau. Acta Ecol. Sin.
