res.2022.114436</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Shetty DJ, Kshirsagar P, Tapadia-Maheshwari S, Lanjekar V, Singh SK, Dhakephalkar PK (2016) &#x201c;Alkali pretreatment at ambient temperature: a promising method to enhance biomethanation of rice straw.&#x201d; Biores Technol 226:80&#x2013;88. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2016.12.003</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.biortech.2016.12.003</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Sol&#xe9;-Bund&#xf3; M, Carr&#xe8;re H, Garf&#xed; M, Ferrer I (2017) Enhancement of microalgae anaerobic digestion by thermo-alkaline pretreatment with lime (CaO). Algal Res 24:199&#x2013;206. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.algal.2017.03.025</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.algal.2017.03.025</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang F, Zhang L, Luo Y, Li Y, Cheng X, Cao J, Wu J, Huang H, Luo J, Su Y (2023a) Surfactant aggravated the antibiotic&#x2019;s stress on antibiotic resistance genes proliferation by altering antibiotic solubilization and microbial traits in sludge anaerobic fermentation. Sci Total Environ 873:162440. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scitotenv.2023.162440</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang P, Wang X, Chen X, Ren L (2021) Effects of bentonite on antibiotic resistance genes in biogas slurry and residue from thermophilic and mesophilic anaerobic digestion of food waste. Biores Technol 336:125322. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2021.125322</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.biortech.2021.125322</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang R, Gu J, Wang Q, Jiang S, Wu Z, Wang J, Li G, Gong X (2023b) Enhancing methane production in dry anaerobic digestion of ruminant manures through substrates ratio regulation for strengthened microbial interactions. Environ Technol Innov 32:103389. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eti.2023.103389</Citation><ArticleIdList><Arti