t. 2013;16:1285&#x2013;93.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23953244</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wookey PA, Parsons NA, Welker JMet al. Comparative responses of phenology and reproductive development to simulated environmental change in subArctic and high Arctic. OIKOS. 1993;67:490&#x2013;502.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Xiong J, Chu H, Sun Het al. Divergent responses of soil fungi functional groups to short-term warming. Microb Ecol. 2014;68::708&#x2013;15.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">24553914</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>
